            <ArticleTitle>Electron-beam computed tomography in the evaluation of patients with chest pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>386-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Electron-beam computed tomography is a promising technology for the noninvasive evaluation of patients with suspected coronary artery disease. However, at the present time there is insufficient clinical evidence to support its widespread use as a screening tool for evaluation of patients with chest pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
